"Update Mistype to %@?" = "要将 Mistype 更新到 %@ 吗？";
"Version %@ is installed. Your settings and learned phrases are kept." = "当前已安装 %@ 版，你的设置与学习到的词组都会保留。";
"Update" = "更新";
"Install Mistype %@" = "安装 Mistype %@";
"This installs the Mistype input method for your account. No administrator password is needed." = "这会为你的账户安装 Mistype 输入法，不需要管理员密码。";
"Install" = "安装";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"An older system-wide copy exists at %@. Remove it, or two Mistype entries will appear." = "在 %@ 发现旧的系统级安装。请移除它，否则会出现两个 Mistype。";
"Mistype is installed" = "Mistype 已安装";
"macOS lists a new input method only after you log in again. Log out and back in once, then add Mistype in System Settings › Keyboard › Input Sources." = "macOS 要等你重新登录后才会列出新的输入法。请先退出登录再登录一次，然后在“系统设置 › 键盘 › 输入法”添加 Mistype。";
"Open System Settings › Keyboard › Input Sources, press +, and add Mistype." = "请打开“系统设置 › 键盘 › 输入法”，点按 +，添加 Mistype。";
"Mistype was updated" = "Mistype 已更新";
"Now version %@. The new version starts the next time you type." = "现为 %@ 版，下次打字时就会启用新版本。";
"Log Out…" = "退出登录…";
"Later" = "稍后";
"Couldn't log out automatically" = "无法自动退出登录";
"Choose Apple menu › Log Out." = "请从苹果菜单选择“退出登录”。";
"Open Keyboard Settings" = "打开键盘设置";
"Done" = "完成";
"Installation failed" = "安装失败";
"Quit" = "退出";
